e demonstration password is appropriately redacted, so its value and entropy cannot be independently inspected; the trace nevertheless shows an archive-specific credential being set and used successfully.","Final source hashes were explicitly collected on node1 only. The identically seeded source tree on node2 was not re-hashed after execution, although no executor command shown modifies that tree."]}
